# VoiceMate — Cursor Agent Rules

## Start here every session

Read `AGENTS.md` before touching any other file. It has exact line numbers
for every major function in server.js and app.js, the full env var list,
branch map, and task recipes. This eliminates the discovery round entirely.

## Token / cost rules

- NEVER read `styles.css` unless the task is purely visual (3,281 lines, almost never needed).
- NEVER read `app.js` or `server.js` top-to-bottom. Use Grep + the line map in AGENTS.md.
- NEVER read `index.html` unless adding new DOM elements.
- ALWAYS use `Grep` with a specific pattern before reaching for `Read`.
- ALWAYS use targeted `StrReplace` edits — never rewrite a whole file.
- ALWAYS use Ask mode (read-only) for exploration and questions. Switch to Agent only when making actual edits.
- Prefer one focused task per session over broad multi-file refactors.

## Branching

Active base: `cursor/file-image-context-fbd0`
New branches: `cursor/<descriptive-name>-bee4`
Never commit to `main`.

## Code style

- Vanilla JS only — no frameworks, no npm packages.
- No comments that just narrate what the code does.
- Match the existing indent/quote style (2-space, double quotes).
- Spoken replies are 1–3 sentences; keep max_completion_tokens at 350.
